<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Italian classic cars worth finding.">
  <title>Italian Finds — Classic Cars</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="wordmark" href="#" aria-label="Italian Finds home">Найдено в Италии</a>
    <a class="contact-link" href="https://t.me/Anna_Chernyakhovskaya" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Telegram">
        <path d="M5.2 11.5 18.8 6.2c.6-.2 1.1.1.9.9l-2.3 10.8c-.2.8-.7 1-1.4.6l-3.8-2.8-1.8 1.7c-.2.2-.4.4-.8.4l.3-3.9 7.1-6.4c.3-.3-.1-.4-.5-.2l-8.8 5.5-3.8-1.2c-.8-.3-.8-.8.2-1.1Z" fill="#229ED9"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="intro">
      <h1>Автомобили, которые стоит отыскать</h1>
      <p class="intro-copy">От хорошо сохранённых икон дизайна до заброшенных раритеров - у каждого автомобиля своя история. И она начинается с поиска..</p>
    </section>
    <section class="car-grid" id="carGrid" aria-label="Car collection"></section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>© Найдено в Италии 2026</span>
  </footer>

  <dialog class="gallery-dialog" id="galleryDialog" aria-label="Car photo gallery">
    <button class="close-button" id="closeGallery" aria-label="Close gallery">×</button>
    <div class="gallery-heading">
      <h2 id="galleryTitle"></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="gallery-grid" id="galleryGrid"></div>
  </dialog>

  <dialog class="lightbox" id="lightbox" aria-label="Full screen media viewer">
    <button class="lightbox-close" id="closeLightbox" aria-label="Close viewer">×</button>
    <button class="lightbox-arrow prev" id="prevImage" aria-label="Previous item">‹</button>
    <div class="lightbox-content" id="lightboxContent"></div>
    <button class="lightbox-arrow next" id="nextImage" aria-label="Next item">›</button>
    <div class="lightbox-counter" id="lightboxCounter"></div>
  </dialog>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
